    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Stella is given a mysterious accessory. When she wakes up, she finds herself in a world of dreams...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253770/extras/f473853cee7db7818f644e457b6658ba.avif?t=1754269452\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A card selection based 3D game between girls. The basic controls use only the mouse, but keyboard operation is also possible. There are two types of cameras, and players can switch between them at any time during play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253770/extras/4ed0dd8ee6a34f08528aa02c5661b8a3.avif?t=1754269452\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy various motions by selecting cards. Some cards marked with a + will change their motion when right-clicked. After completing story mode, free play will be unlocked. Free mode can be played endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253770/extras/ae851c08ad1c6ba1cbc3e10123697d22.avif?t=1754269452\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo version, only one chapter is available. In the first chapter, only low-rank cards will appear.</p>",
